id42-agent builds and runs nanobot. nanobot is not relicensed.

Upstream: https://github.com/HKUDS/nanobot
Pinned release: v0.4.2
Pinned commit: 0dc8679edcc6061fbcdf3de13c7e16000e9d1b65

The image is produced from that commit's Dockerfile, then id42-work is
installed into a separate virtualenv. The Dockerfile copies nanobot's LICENSE
and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md into the image. Those files stay in every image
this repository builds.

id42-work is Apache-2.0 and is not relicensed.
